  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two masses <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m_{1}\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m_{2}\"></span> are connected by a string over a frictionless pulley of negligible mass. The masses are released from rest. Air resistance is negligible.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m_{2}\"></span> accelerates downwards at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{g}{2}\"></span>. What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{m_{1}}{m_{2}}\"></span>?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\">2</li><li data-label=\"D\">3</li></ol>"
